                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-thermometer-half"></i> 2 temp.</span>
                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-cloud"></i> humidité</span>
                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i> luminosité</span>
