                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-water"></i> pompe</span>
                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-thermometer-half"></i> temp. air</span>
                <span class="project-badge"><i class="fas fa-tint"></i> humidité air</span>
